    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Fixed the main-menu font status. The game scan was replacing the card while the pointer was over it, which made the status flash and disappear. Hovering or focusing Aa X/Y now keeps a clear status panel visible. A complete 2/2 count is read-only and does not start another download; missing or failed fonts remain clickable and show progress in the same panel. The hidden and rendered UI checks passed. Restart Lexeditor if the main menu was already open, then hover Aa 2/2 and click it once to confirm that the panel stays visible and no loading flash appears.",
